<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\電車詰所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hey, wake up already, it's almost time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Mmm...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Geez, that's what you get for staying up late at your age."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hwaah... 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah, almost time for the scheduled train... 
{PAUSE ""}
Sorry, but take over this next run for me...<PG>
"Not again... Past 70 and you're still like this..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You're pretty doddery yourself these days.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Driving trains is the only fun I've got. 
{PAUSE ""}
I retired and took it easy for a while, but driving trains just suits me after all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Well, same goes for me.<PG>
"Then take your turn like you're supposed to..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You want me driving on no sleep? There'll be an accident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"By that logic, I was up all night playing <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="マージャン">mahjong</STYLE> with you too. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah, forget it, I'll go."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Counting on you. There are only two drivers left for the Arata Station run, so look after yourself.<PG>
"Always so glib... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, it's fun, so it's fine."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hey, hey, changing the subject, but haven't the Arata folks seemed weird lately?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You noticed too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―How do I put it... gloomy, or something...<PG>
"They've always been gloomy, haven't they?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―But I feel like up until a few years ago they were a little more cheerful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"More than gloomy, it's like they've become different people?
{PAUSE ""}
　No life in them, all dull and heavy..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I can't put it well, but something like that. Driving out there's been scary lately.<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
